    "description": "<p><strong>Tech</strong></p><p>Make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> to attack a target within Very Close range with a monofilament wire. On a success they take <strong>d8+2</strong> kinetic damage using your Proficiency. If a target you hit is <em>Vulnerable</em>, use <strong>d12</strong> as the damage die.</p><p><strong>Charged:</strong> <strong>Spend a Charge</strong> and make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> to unleash a web of hyper-sharp wires that lashes out at all targets within Very Close range. Targets you succeed against take <strong>d8+2</strong> kinetic damage using your Proficiency. If a target you hit is <em>Vulnerable</em>, use <strong>d12</strong> as the damage die.</p>",
